{"ID":"20251104161745-haxwvho","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251104161745-haxwvho","title":"UPL9-3——LOD","type":"doc","updated":"20251104172612"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104161745-2p64l35","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251104161745-2p64l35","updated":"20251104172612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LOD"}]},{"ID":"20251104161911-n0nepuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104161911-n0nepuq","updated":"20251104162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LOD（Level of Detail，细节层次）"}]},{"ID":"20251104162029-g3xolap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162029-g3xolap","updated":"20251104162053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LOD 的核心目的：减少远处物体的几何复杂度（顶点，三角形数量），降低 GPU 顶点处理压力，让场景在视觉上几乎无损的前提下提升性能"}]},{"ID":"20251104162055-efo6ydm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162055-efo6ydm","updated":"20251104162100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体好处包括："}]},{"ID":"20251104162100-ell4qj4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104162100-ell4qj4","updated":"20251104162101"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104162101-ptv7oiv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104162101-ptv7oiv","updated":"20251104162101"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104162101-53o4vzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162101-53o4vzx","updated":"20251104162104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提升性能"}]},{"ID":"20251104162118-0cb99ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162118-0cb99ne","updated":"20251104162208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"远处的物体在屏幕上只占很少像素，用高模浪费算力，LOD 可以替换成低模，让 GPU 处理更轻松"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104162104-odp4mjv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104162104-odp4mjv","updated":"20251104162104"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104162104-x2i3m3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162104-x2i3m3c","updated":"20251104162110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"节省显存和带宽"}]},{"ID":"20251104162208-c2hlk2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162208-c2hlk2c","updated":"20251104162256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高模 → 低模 → Billboard 加载和显存压力逐步减轻"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104162110-croqm2g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251104162110-croqm2g","updated":"20251104162110"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104162110-f9rirc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162110-f9rirc5","updated":"20251104162117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兼顾画质与性能"}]},{"ID":"20251104162257-e4c77z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162257-e4c77z4","updated":"20251104162318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近处依旧报错高质量，远处用简化版本，玩家几乎察觉不到"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104162320-7t0946h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162320-7t0946h","updated":"20251104162356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：LOD 的主要作用就是动态平衡画质和性能"}]},{"ID":"20251104162356-pga0jai","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251104162356-pga0jai","name":"LOD Group","updated":"20251104172612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LOD 的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251104162419-n759t0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162419-n759t0s","updated":"20251104162523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 提供了 LOD Group 组件来管理 LOD"}]},{"ID":"20251104162523-7bncd4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162523-7bncd4x","updated":"20251104162528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用步骤："}]},{"ID":"20251104162528-pvergfe","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104162528-pvergfe","updated":"20251104165311"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104162531-yrvnvbq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104162531-yrvnvbq","updated":"20251104162531"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104162531-v58zaci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162531-v58zaci","updated":"20251104162537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"准备好模型"}]},{"ID":"20251104162617-nva8u5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162617-nva8u5i","updated":"20251104162728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让美术输出同一个物体的多个精度版本模型（如 LOD0、LOD1、LOD2）\n或者使用 Mesh Simplification（网格简化算法）工具自动生成低精度模型"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104162537-16nht56","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104162537-16nht56","updated":"20251104165311"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104162537-fex0ml1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162537-fex0ml1","updated":"20251104162611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建一个空物体，添加 LOD Group 组件，将多个精度版本模型作为其子对象"}]},{"ID":"20251104162614-w08w8ha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104162614-w08w8ha","updated":"20251104162741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对 LOD Group 组件进行设置关联"}]},{"ID":"20251104163505-zej40bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104163505-zej40bd","updated":"20251104163740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设我们准备了胶囊体高模，球体中模，立方体低模，你需要将这些模型的渲染器分别关联到 LOD Group 的不同等级 (LOD X) 的 Renderers 上"}]},{"ID":"20251104163743-p27bl9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104163743-p27bl9d","updated":"20251104163937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 805px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104163937-ztbages.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 805px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251104163948-knjib0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104163948-knjib0e","updated":"20251104165311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后就可以看到效果了（从近到远，依次从高模变成低模，最终被剔除）："}]},{"ID":"20251104164022-95009ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164022-95009ur","updated":"20251104165230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104164034-drd6r73.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104164050-voflu10.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104164102-mz13zd0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104164121-fb145v8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104162741-pcb9u7b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251104162741-pcb9u7b","updated":"20251104172612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LOD Group 参数"}]},{"ID":"20251104164242-fu2wua4","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20251104164242-fu2wua4","updated":"20251104172612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20251104164203-d49stky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164203-d49stky","updated":"20251104172451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104172451-12skqc8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251104164236-8bpmd87","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251104164236-8bpmd87","updated":"20251104172612"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164236-kigg48s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251104164236-kigg48s","updated":"20251104172350"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164236-npysa08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164236-npysa08","updated":"20251104164300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Fade Mode：控制 LOD 切换时是否做过渡"}]},{"ID":"20251104165517-20aovjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104165517-20aovjl","updated":"20251104165537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104165537-22teewg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251104164300-w03ti5q","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251104164300-w03ti5q","updated":"20251104172350"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164300-917zep3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251104164300-917zep3","updated":"20251104164300"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164300-hus4q0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164300-hus4q0i","updated":"20251104164414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"None（无过渡）： 直接切换，没有过渡效果"}]},{"ID":"20251104164414-q94r8ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164414-q94r8ao","updated":"20251104164419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能最好，因为不需要额外渲染，\n缺点是可能出现“跳变”感，尤其是当物体在切换点来回抖动时"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104164307-qtzucov","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104164307-qtzucov","updated":"20251104172350"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164307-hwcz6lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164307-hwcz6lg","updated":"20251104164430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cross Fade（渐变过渡）: Unity 会在切换区间内同时渲染"}]},{"ID":"20251104164431-re9692o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164431-re9692o","updated":"20251104164512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两个 LOD 的模型，旧 LOD 逐渐透明，新 LOD 逐渐显现\n最终实现一个“淡入淡出”的效果，过渡平滑，几乎察觉不到 LOD 切换\n由于在过渡阶段要同时渲染两个模型，会给 GPU 带来负担"}]},{"ID":"20251104172310-8a8qvev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104172310-8a8qvev","updated":"20251104172350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调整过渡区间需要在各个 LOD 等级的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251104172233-wbpnxkh","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Fade Transition Width"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 处调节"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104164314-htgnr56","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251104164314-htgnr56","updated":"20251104164314"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164314-3i3sjwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164314-3i3sjwf","updated":"20251104164314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Speed Tree（植被系统）: 专门为 Unity 的 SpeedTree 植被系统设计的渐变模式"}]},{"ID":"20251104164519-ehqp972","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164519-ehqp972","updated":"20251104164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"逐步混合顶点、枝叶信息，在切换过程中，树木的枝叶会更自然地过渡，\n不会出现“透明闪烁” 针对树木、植被表现更好\n只能用于 SpeedTree 资源，无法用于普通 Mesh"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104164323-kk04za2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251104164323-kk04za2","updated":"20251104164323"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164323-vg691kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164323-vg691kl","updated":"20251104165439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Animate Cross-fading：会让淡入淡出的过程随着时间平滑播放动画，而不是仅仅基于相机位置的阈值（仅在 Fade Mode 不为 None 时出现）"}]},{"ID":"20251104165417-8op6v4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104165417-8op6v4u","updated":"20251104165505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"勾选后会更快速更直接切换模型，不会出现摄像机停在某个阈值点让两个模型都显示的情况"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104164236-ngvtgaq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251104164236-ngvtgaq","updated":"20251104164236"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164236-mxpj1ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164236-mxpj1ws","updated":"20251104171422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拖动条：预览不同物体占屏幕比值的LOD等级，拖动可预览不同距离显示效果"}]},{"ID":"20251104165943-r3gx0i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104165943-r3gx0i5","updated":"20251104170033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104170033-49zzf6f.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251104165901-yk3wvqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104165901-yk3wvqg","updated":"20251104170255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上面的百分比（100%、60%、30%、10%）表示屏幕占比阈值\n（一般是基于物体的包围盒在屏幕上投影的高度，去和 屏幕总高度 做比值）\n比如：当物体在屏幕上大小 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\u003c"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 30% 时，从 LOD1 切换到 LOD2\n拖动摄像机图标可以看到切换效果"}]},{"ID":"20251104171239-7qllf5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104171239-7qllf5o","updated":"20251104171240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104171240-4j788ia.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104170613-s2z6uu2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251104170613-s2z6uu2","updated":"20251104170613"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104170613-hl5mo3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104170613-hl5mo3j","updated":"20251104170652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"警告：Active LOD bias is 2.0. Distances are adjusted accordingly"}]},{"ID":"20251104170626-z3fri84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104170626-z3fri84","updated":"20251104170711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表示当前项目里启用了 Quality Settings → LOD Bias（LOD 偏移）\n值越大，切换到低 LOD 的时机越远（即更久保留高模）"}]},{"ID":"20251104170740-2mp0igj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104170740-2mp0igj","updated":"20251104170832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104170832-n2ppa21.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104164236-g2al6al","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251104164236-g2al6al","updated":"20251104164236"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104164236-3x8x0vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104164236-3x8x0vh","updated":"20251104171528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Recalculate Bounds：重新计算 LOD 的包围盒（建议模型设置完毕变时点击）"}]},{"ID":"20251